*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines/test_redefines_nested_group_with_numeric
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BASE PIC X(8) VALUE "12345678".
01 WS-REDEF REDEFINES WS-BASE.
   05 WS-N1 PIC 9(4).
   05 WS-N2 PIC 9(4).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ADD 1 TO WS-N1.
    ADD 1 TO WS-N2.
    DISPLAY WS-N1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-N1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1235"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1235] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-N2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-N2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "5679"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [5679] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

